+ * Backed by a single Map, whose iteration order is insertion order: the first
+ * key is the least recently used and the last key is the most recently used.
+ * Refreshing an entry is done by deleting and re-inserting it, so every
+ * operation is O(1) and keys follow Map (SameValueZero) semantics.
+ */
